  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacion del Banco Nacional de Fomento BNF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support the Modernization of Banco Nacional de Fomento</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es la modernizacin y el fortalecimiento dela capacidad institucional del BNF, que le permita incrementar el financiamiento a las micro, pequea y medianas empresas (MiPymes) y sectores de menores ingresos en Paraguay y as cumplir su mandato de desarrollo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to modernize and strengthen BNF&apos;s institutional capacity, allowing it to increase financing for micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs) and low-income sectors in Paraguay and thus fulfill its development mandate.</narrative>
  </description>
